OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 13 APR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Chopin
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod enters the
OL,6,     GParisian world of Frederic
OL,7,     GChopin. Today, the young composer
OL,8,     Gtries to get himself noticed on
OL,9,     Gthe city's exclusive salon
OL,10,     Gcircuit.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,13,     Gmusic in the studio from pianist
OL,14,     GFilippo Gorini and Gaelic singer
OL,15,     GRuairidh Gray.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GWind down with half an hour of
OL,18,     Gback to back classical music,
OL,19,     Gincluding works by Rachmaninov,
OL,20,     GBach, and Grant Still.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
